<title>FRANCE: BNP stake in Axa falls under five pct.</title>
<headline>BNP stake in Axa falls under five pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque Nationale de Paris (BNP) holds less than five percent of the voting rights in insurance group Axa-UAP after selling Axa shares in the market, the financial markets regulator CMF said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that BNP holds 4.986 percent of the voting rights through its subsidiaries Financiere BNP and BNP Arbitrage.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
